<p>For the first 30 minutes of your day, everyday, I implore you to attempt the following:</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>No screens whatsoever</strong></li>
<li><strong>Get water in with salts</strong></li>
<li><strong>Get a sweat on</strong></li>
</ol>
<p><em>I love Sun salutations as my opening exercise, opening up my hips and lower back, I highly recommend them as an addition to any First 30 routine.</em></p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Meditate while you are moving</strong></li>
<li><strong>Ideally do this in the rising Sun</strong> (My Northern brothers are out of luck on this one)</li>
</ol>
<p>I ask that you report back in 30 days from adopting this habit and let me know how you feel.</p>
<p>I believe your mind will be <strong>blown</strong>.</p>